UNPROVISIONED
# Replace this file with the minisign public key file (`minisign -G` writes it) of the CURRENT
# desktop-image signing key before a release build (docs/ipc.md 6.12, "Images manifest"). This is a
# SEPARATE key pair from the release keys in ../release-keys: its secret half lives in the GitHub
# environment `image-signing` (main branch only, no per-run approval), so a leaked image key can
# never sign an agent release. A build that embeds no image key accepts no prebuilt image: `auto`
# builds on the server (reason NO_IMAGE_KEY) and `prebuilt` fails FAILED_PRECONDITION.
